---
---
<section class="sec sec-tint devsec" id="devices">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow center" data-en="One account · every device" data-sw="Akaunti moja · kila kifaa">One account · every device</span>
      <h2 data-en="Sell on your phone, your counter, or your computer." data-sw="Uza kwa simu yako, kaunta yako, au kompyuta yako.">Sell on your phone, your counter, or your computer.</h2>
      <p
        data-en='Ring up a sale on the POS terminal, check it on your phone, run reports on your computer — it all syncs in real time. <span class="sw">Popote ulipo.</span>'
        data-sw='Toza mauzo kwenye POS terminal, angalia kwenye simu yako, endesha ripoti kwenye kompyuta — vyote vinasawazishwa wakati huo huo. <span class="sw">Popote ulipo.</span>'
      >Ring up a sale on the POS terminal, check it on your phone, run reports on your computer — it all syncs in real time. <span class="sw">Popote ulipo.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px;" class="reveal">
      <span class="sync-pill"><span class="sd"></span> <span data-en="Real-time sync across all your devices" data-sw="Usawazishaji wa wakati halisi katika vifaa vyako vyote">Real-time sync across all your devices</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="devstage">
      <!-- phone -->
      <div class="dev reveal">
        <div class="dev-phone">
          <div class="scrn">
            <div class="mini-bar"><div class="md"><i style="background:#ec6a5e"></i><i style="background:#f4bf4f"></i><i style="background:#61c454"></i></div><span class="mt">BiasharaPOS</span><span class="mst">● live</span></div>
            <div class="mini-profit"><div class="l" data-en="Net profit · this sale" data-sw="Faida halisi · mauzo haya">Net profit · this sale</div><div class="v">+TZS 4,200</div></div>
            <div class="mini-row"><span class="ic" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dbe7fb,#fff)"></span><span class="nm">Cooking Oil 2L</span><span class="pr">9,500</span></div>
            <div class="mini-row"><span class="ic" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e6f6ea,#fff)"></span><span class="nm">Rice 5kg</span><span class="pr">22,000</span></div>
            <div class="mini-btn" data-en="Charge sale" data-sw="Toza mauzo">Charge sale</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cap"><b data-en="Mobile app" data-sw="App ya simu">Mobile app</b><span data-en="Sell on the go" data-sw="Uza popote">Sell on the go</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- SUNMI V3 PLUS, drawn front-on so the till is legible. The
           customer-facing screen sits on the back of the printer head, so it
           is not visible from this side — described in the note instead. -->
      <div class="dev reveal">
        <div class="dev-v3">
          <div class="v3-head">
            <div class="v3-receipt"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="v3-band">SUNMI V3 PLUS</div>
          </div>
          <div class="v3-body">
            <div class="scrn">
              <div class="till-head"><b data-en="Till · Kaunta 1" data-sw="Till · Kaunta 1">Till · Kaunta 1</b><span>● live</span></div>
              <div class="till-lines">
                <div><span>Sukari 1kg × 2</span><b>6,400</b></div>
                <div><span>Mafuta 2L</span><b>9,500</b></div>
                <div><span>Mchele 5kg</span><b>22,000</b></div>
              </div>
              <div class="till-total"><span data-en="Total" data-sw="Jumla">Total</span><b>TZS 37,900</b></div>
              <div class="till-profit"><span data-en="Net profit" data-sw="Faida halisi">Net profit</span><b>+TZS 5,180</b></div>
              <div class="till-pay"><i class="on">M-Pesa</i><i>Mixx</i><i>Cash</i></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cap"><b>SUNMI V3 PLUS</b><span data-en="Handheld, printer built in" data-sw="Ya mkononi, printa ndani">Handheld, printer built in</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- SUNMI FLEX 3 — counter display on its stand. No printer of its own. -->
      <div class="dev reveal">
        <div class="dev-flex">
          <div class="fx-panel">
            <div class="fx-glass">
              <div class="scrn">
                <div class="till-head"><b data-en="Counter · Kaunta 2" data-sw="Kaunta 2">Counter · Kaunta 2</b><span>● live</span></div>
                <div class="till-lines">
                  <div><span>Kitenge Dress</span><b>48,000</b></div>
                  <div><span>Linen Shirt × 2</span><b>64,000</b></div>
                </div>
                <div class="till-total"><span data-en="Total" data-sw="Jumla">Total</span><b>TZS 112,000</b></div>
                <div class="till-profit"><span data-en="Net profit" data-sw="Faida halisi">Net profit</span><b>+TZS 24,600</b></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fx-neck"></div>
          <div class="fx-foot"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cap"><b>SUNMI FLEX 3</b><span data-en="Fixed counter screen" data-sw="Skrini ya kaunta">Fixed counter screen</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- computer -->
      <div class="dev reveal">
        <div class="dev-comp">
          <div class="lid">
            <div class="scrn">
              <div class="mini-bar"><span class="mt" data-en="Back office · Today" data-sw="Ofisi · Leo">Back office · Today</span><span class="mst">● synced</span></div>
              <div class="comp-grid2">
                <div class="comp-bars"><i style="height:38%"></i><i style="height:55%"></i><i style="height:48%"></i><i style="height:70%"></i><i style="height:62%"></i><i class="hi" style="height:92%"></i></div>
                <div class="comp-chips">
                  <div class="comp-chip green"><div class="l" data-en="Net profit" data-sw="Faida halisi">Net profit</div><div class="v">TZS 312,400</div></div>
                  <div class="comp-chip"><div class="l" data-en="Sales today" data-sw="Mauzo ya leo">Sales today</div><div class="v">TZS 847,500</div></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="base"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cap"><b data-en="Computer" data-sw="Kompyuta">Computer</b><span data-en="Reports & back office" data-sw="Ripoti na ofisi">Reports &amp; back office</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="devnote reveal">
      <p
        data-en="We run BiasharaPOS on two SUNMI terminals. The V3 PLUS is the handheld above — the receipt printer is in its head and a small screen on the back faces your customer. The FLEX 3 is a large touchscreen for a fixed counter, from 15.6 to 27 inches, that prints to a separate receipt printer. Both are Android, and BiasharaPOS runs in the browser, so there is nothing to install on either."
        data-sw="Tunaendesha BiasharaPOS kwenye terminal mbili za SUNMI. V3 PLUS ndiyo ya mkononi iliyo hapo juu — printa ya risiti iko kichwani mwake na skrini ndogo nyuma inamwelekea mteja. FLEX 3 ni skrini kubwa ya kugusa kwa kaunta ya kudumu, kuanzia inchi 15.6 hadi 27, inayochapisha kwenye printa ya risiti ya pembeni. Zote ni Android, na BiasharaPOS inafanya kazi kwenye kivinjari, hivyo hakuna cha kusakinisha kwenye yoyote."
      >We run BiasharaPOS on two SUNMI terminals. The V3 PLUS is the handheld above — the receipt printer is in its head and a small screen on the back faces your customer. The FLEX 3 is a large touchscreen for a fixed counter, from 15.6 to 27 inches, that prints to a separate receipt printer. Both are Android, and BiasharaPOS runs in the browser, so there is nothing to install on either.</p>
      <p
        class="devnote-sub"
        data-en="It is not required. BiasharaPOS runs the same on any Android phone, tablet or computer with a browser."
        data-sw="Si lazima. BiasharaPOS inafanya kazi vivyo hivyo kwenye simu yoyote ya Android, tableti au kompyuta yenye kivinjari."
      >It is not required. BiasharaPOS runs the same on any Android phone, tablet or computer with a browser.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
